=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Tweet This\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/twitter20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Subscribe by email\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Subscribe by RSS\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;</div>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"Josh Lobe\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2255:\"<h2>WP Edit Pro Version 4.1.1</h2>\n<h3>IMPORTANT SECURITY RELEASE &#8211; Please Update Immediately</h3>\n<p>I believe a security vulnerability has been found in WP Edit Pro.  Specifically; it pertains to the script used to upload custom fonts.  For this reason, I have temporarily removed the custom fonts option.</p>\n<p>I will replace this option with a more secure approach in the next plugin version.</p>\n<h4>Miscellaneous</h4>\n<p>Some other small tweaks in this version include:</p>\n<p>1) A license check was performed whenever the plugin options were saved.  This sometimes caused legitimately registered licenses to self-deactivate.  This particular license check has been removed from the plugin.</p>\n<p>2) The dropbox API key alert has been removed.</p>\n<p>3) The license extension url in the admin notice has been corrected.</p>\n<Img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" alt=\"\" style=\"border:0;float:left;margin:0;padding:0\" hspace=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/119260477/0/wpeditpro\">\n<div style=\"clear:both;padding-top:0.2em;\"><a title=\"Like on Facebook\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Share on Google+\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/30/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/googleplus20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Pin it!\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/119260477/wpeditpro,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Tweet This\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/twitter20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Subscribe by email\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;<a title=\"Subscribe by RSS\" href=\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/119260477/wpeditpro\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"http://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" style=\"border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\"></a>&#160;</div>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:36:\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\";a:1:{s:10:\"commentRss\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:76:\"http://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/119260477/0/wpeditpro~WP-Edit-Pro-Version/feed/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:38:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\";a:1:{s:8:\"comments\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:1:\"0\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\